## v2 RESTRUCTURE (founder rated v1 2.5/5: theoretical, verification-first, missing the bedrock)
Eight brainstorming decisions ratified 2026-07-24, all (a):
1. Output = a design DOSSIER: numbered, versioned artifacts, each with its own completeness gate.
2. Ceremony sized by a SCORED INTAKE (5 questions -> tier T0/T1/T2/T3), override named and logged.
3. Architecture decided by DECISION TABLES with named criteria and thresholds, consultation as intake,
   output = recommendation + first and second alternative + what would flip it (an ADR).
4. Data: conceptual -> logical -> physical, the three lenses (engineer, analyst, scientist) applied
   in that order at the logical gate; source-system map and failover inside the model.
5. Diagrams AS CODE (Mermaid), tier-sized required set, cross-checked against the dossier by a script.
6. Q&A checkpoints fixed at artifact gates + 4 named forcing conditions (ambiguity that changes design,
   discovered contradiction, hard-gate collision, disproven assumption).
7. Every law: WHEN / INPUTS / RULE / OUTPUT / ENFORCED BY. No enforcement point = it moves to Practices.
8. v2 = reframe and extend: keep the gate engine, add the design spine above it, retarget gates to
   design artifacts, rewrite the whitepaper in the real order (purpose, process, architecture, data,
   expression, verification).

